            "created_at": "2025-08-30T06:43:43.20759+00:00",
            "notes": "In round 2, you'll buy whichever power you didn't buy in the first round between [Blitz Barrage](item_b6bd0c8f-9bd2-4d3d-a353-1e70f74e131b) and [Recursion Battery](item_88c3fb1a-2d38-4d2c-b439-6aadd038fd1a). From this point, you need to take [Overcharged Ordnance](item_f261877b-39e5-4248-aeca-7fe34de8ce10) to make the mini-rockets splash consistently. Take as much AP as you can afford, I like to pick [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6) and [Energized Bracers](item_f83a1d9e-91f8-4d2c-bd62-c673b8d9fd2e) for 40 total AP. With any leftover cash, just buy more AP.\n\n[Recursion Battery](item_88c3fb1a-2d38-4d2c-b439-6aadd038fd1a) has really strong healing, but only if you're landing the rockets. Don't worry too much about splashing yourself; the healing is more than enough to keep you up, and self-damage does not increase when you increase your AP.\n\nAt this point, you'll be quite strong already, but you still need to be careful, as you don't have much mobility and your mini-barage is on an 8-second cooldown. Expect to die a lot as you need to be aggressive for the rockets to land consistently, but of course, that also puts you directly in harm's way. You'll win just about any 1v1 you take, but don't expect to take on the whole team by yourself (yet).",
