            "notes": "Pick [Fuel Conversion](item_3a9eb041-da45-4df3-83ed-6d62fd58e5df) as your next power, giving you twice as many mini-barages and exponentially increasing the potency of this build. At this point, you are basically unstoppable, but you will have to play grounded so that you have enough fuel to use your mini-barage off cooldown. \n\nTaking [Forward Shielding](item_d4e14a06-cff6-47f6-aba7-c9df420588f3) is a must here. Every time you use your mini-barage, it'll give you 75+ overhealth, as well as giving you 25 base HP and 10 AP. If you're doing well and have extra cash, then just keep buying AP. \n\nNote about [Carpet Bomb](item_3c2ba051-0447-4a1c-8e07-8948136dff94): I really don't like this perk until the very end of the game. The extra move speed during barrage is nice, but the increased duration will get you killed more times than it will be useful. If something isn't dead by the time your mini-barage ends, it's probably because you died yourself. It also just can't compete with having twice as many activations (50% dash cdr). I know it can be annoying to have to play grounded to save your fuel, but it's so worth it when you see how much damage you can pump out.",
