            "notes": "From here on out, just stack as much AP as you can. Never sell [Overcharged Ordnance](item_f261877b-39e5-4248-aeca-7fe34de8ce10) or [Forward Shielding](item_d4e14a06-cff6-47f6-aba7-c9df420588f3), they are critical to the build. \n\nMy other recommended perks:\n[Champion's Kit](item_8682f8c7-8811-439b-8d50-fa81cd43ddce) and [Catalytic Crystal](item_3e3f4f77-cdf8-4dda-a5b0-2fb9390aefc4) if you want to shred, or [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) and [Lumerico Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8) if you need survivability.",
